{"id":18263,"name":"Lapeer County","slug":"lapeer-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/lapeer-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:36","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","typicalSaleDate":"August and October","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 Pre-authorization on a major credit card","extra":[{"label":"Payment Methods","value":"Bank transfer, certified check, credit/debit card"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Michigan Public Land Auction"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Lapeer Official County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"6dPogtxNDl3arDSNKkiGhVE46n07QAc5SmPFLIl1WRmsbXAptYu82MRsnqH395vc\"><iframe title=\"Unlock 40-90% Discounts on Auction Properties - Lapeer County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9O2A9TlWioA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Unlock-40-90%-Discounts-on-Auction-Properties---Lapeer-County,-Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">40-90% Discounts on Auction Properties in Lapeer County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking to snag real estate at a huge discount? Lapeer County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan,</mark></a> offers an excellent opportunity with their tax deed sales. These auctions allow you to purchase properties at 40% to 90% off their market value due to unpaid taxes. It’s a fantastic way to invest in real estate with a relatively low entry cost.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-steps-to-start-in-lapeer-county-tax-auction\">Steps to Start in Lapeer County Tax Auction</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s crucial to know the legal framework for tax deed sales in Michigan. The process involves a three-year forfeiture and foreclosure period, during which the county seizes properties with unpaid taxes and then auctions them off.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Lapeer County Treasurer&#8217;s website provides detailed information on tax deed sales. It provides information about the auction process, sale dates, and required documentation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lapeercountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Lapeer County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Visit the Michigan Public Land Auction website for specific details on properties available for auction and to register for bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/onlinesales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Lapeer County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details about Tax Deeds</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understanding the sale schedule, property details, and auction rules is essential. Auctions open for advance bidding 30 days prior to the sale date.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Auction Information</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If you have any specific queries or need additional information, the Lapeer County Treasurer&#8217;s Office can provide the help you need.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lapeercountymi.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Contact Information</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-important-details-summary\">Important Details Summary</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lapeer-County-Michigan-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18279 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Lapeer County, Michigan Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-investor-s-pro-tips\">Investor&#8217;s Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework</strong>: Research each property in Lapeer County thoroughly before bidding. Check for any liens, property conditions, and local zoning laws.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Monitor No-Reserve Auctions</strong>: These auctions can offer incredibly low starting bids on unsold properties.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay Honest</strong>: Ensure you have no unpaid taxes or fines in the county where you&#8217;re buying. Misrepresentation can lead to felony charges.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-faqs\">FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Who can bid on these properties?</strong> <br>A: In Lapeer County, anyone who doesn&#8217;t have unpaid property taxes or fines can bid. You must also sign an affidavit confirming this.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if I win a bid?</strong> <br>A: You&#8217;ll receive an email with instructions on completing your purchase, including payment and paperwork details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I modify or delete my bid?</strong> <br>A: Yes, during the advance bidding phase, you can modify or delete your bids until active bidding starts.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-useful-links\">Useful Links</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lapeercountymi.gov/departments/treasurer/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Lapeer County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\">Need a Hand?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Need help navigating the world of tax deed investing? <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a> or access <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferr